\begin{enumerate}
   \item What is the estimated value of the intercept? Please answer with the EAP estimate, even roughly.
   \item As a result of the regression analysis, how much different do you think the mean of Text B is compared to Text A? Please answer with the 95\% interval, even roughly.
   \item As a result of the regression analysis, how much different do you think the mean of Text C is compared to Text A? Please answer with the 95\% interval, even roughly.
   \item As a result of the regression analysis, is it reasonable to claim that there is a difference in the mean of Text D compared to Text A? Please judge by looking at the graph of \verb|conditional_effects|.
\end{enumerate}
